    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed8402bd8a559c12f173ba1e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度有十二分迅速时提升速度\\n智力也十二分超群时大幅提升速度\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69c80d9f8cc49670ac3a94e2d37ad80ceca4f3258edc29173bec891d683e4d3",
