      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e75e246be51840253779157",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时\\n若位于后方则回复\\n少量体力＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "977b0bcb2d13c82f0218b9cdde8e3596949be3d9e3b16219c86623f1552e7fc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202892"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa9f5abe76db313e31b9b439",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若位于中后方\\n则速度提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee7f07d6b42226c9da1271bd44f5286513e3dc05bea162041cb6e0a2af4e1600",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c366f90892e2f13601ff45a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若位于中后方\\n则速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b76b37aabf50b2ed9ffac7d55dd14d34266ae2aa0af05dfe14cfba9b4dd24dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "202902"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5084c25131dc61ab97ad49a",
